    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb one-bedroom, open-plan first-floor apartment, ideally located in a sought-after area.\r\n\r\nThis stunning property features an entrance hall with laminate flooring, which continues into the bedroom and living area, along with a hotpress. To the left of the hallway is the bathroom, with tiled floors and partially tiled walls. The spacious double bedroom enjoys plenty of natural light and comes with built-in wardrobes. The bright, open-plan living and dining area opens onto a west-facing balconette, creating a warm and inviting space. The accommodation is completed by a charming kitchen with tiled flooring, splashback tiling, and plenty of cupboard and counter space. The apartment also benefits from a secure, designated car space and lift access.\r\n\r\nBow Bridge House is a secure, gated development nestled along the scenic banks of the River Camac. Nearby amenities include Heuston South Quarter, offering a variety of shops, cafés, a gym, creche, and pharmacy. The Red Line Luas is just a short walk away, providing easy access to the city centre. For outdoor leisure, IMMA, The Memorial Gardens, and Phoenix Park are all within easy reach."
      },
